# Sources: Fakhreddin Azimi, Iran: The Crisis of Democracy, 1941–1953,
# ch. 5, pp. 250–267; official Majles proceedings, session 25, 18 May 1950.
# Mechanical effects are counterfactual abstractions.
title: <span class="term term-constitutionalist">Allahyar Saleh</span>
new-page: true
